     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Price and difference",
     "texto": [
      "In **A 比 B + adjective**, 比 introduces what you compare with. You can add a difference after the adjective: **这件比那件贵二十块** = this one costs twenty yuan more than that one.",
      "**长** means «long»; when placed with pants or a garment, it describes its length."
     ],
